      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">OKINAWA, JAPAN</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Once #1 in disability-free life expectancy</text>\n                    <rect x=\"60\" y=\"180\" width=\"460\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"290\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">SIGNATURE HABITS</text>\n                    <text x=\"290\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Hara hachi bu</text>\n                    <text x=\"290\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Imo (purple sweet potato)</text>\n                    <text x=\"290\" y=\"360\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Goya & turmeric</text>\n                    <text x=\"290\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Moai friend circles</text>\n                    <text x=\"290\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Ikigai purpose</text>\n                    <text x=\"290\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Tatami floor living</text>\n                    <rect x=\"580\" y=\"180\" width=\"460\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"810\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">DIET MAKEUP (HISTORICAL)</text>\n                    <text x=\"810\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">67% sweet potato</text>\n                    <text x=\"810\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">10% vegetables</text>\n                    <text x=\"810\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">10% rice & grains</text>\n                    <text x=\"810\" y=\"410\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">8% soy (tofu, miso)</text>\n                    <text x=\"810\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">5% fish, occasional pork</text>\n                    <rect x=\"100\" y=\"550\" width=\"900\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE BLUE ZONE IS SHRINKING</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Post-WWII American bases brought fast food</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"690\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">By 2000, Okinawan male obesity surpassed mainland</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">The grandparents still thrive; the grandkids may not</text>\n                    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"820\" width=\"700\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"870\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">LESSON FOR US</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"915\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Longevity is environmental, not eternal</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"960\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">A Blue Zone can be lost in one generation</text>\n                </svg>",
      "caption": "Okinawa's gift — and the warning hidden in it"
