     "explanation": "**Marinac et al. (2017, JAMA Oncology)** analyzed 2,413 women from the Women's Healthy Eating and Living study and found that those whose nightly fast exceeded **13 hours had a 36% lower risk of breast cancer recurrence** compared to women fasting less than 13 hours overnight. The proposed mechanisms: improved glycemic control, lower nighttime insulin, and enhanced autophagy. This is why the Blue Zone pattern of dinner-by-7 and breakfast-after-7 is biologically meaningful even without calorie counting.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\">\n                    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">The Marinac fasting study</text>\n                    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"200\" width=\"800\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">MARINAC 2017</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">JAMA Oncology, 2413 women</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Womens Healthy Eating + Living cohort</text>\n                    <rect x=\"150\" y=\"460\" width=\"800\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">FASTING >13 HR</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"580\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"26\">36% LOWER RECURRENCE</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"640\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Breast cancer recurrence specifically</text>\n                    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"720\" width=\"700\" height=\"280\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"780\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">MECHANISMS</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"830\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Glycemic control improved</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"870\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Nighttime insulin lower</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"910\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Autophagy enhanced</text>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"970\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Same physiology that Blue Zones run on</text>\n                </svg>",
      "caption": "Why dinner-by-7 isn't just a quirky habit"
     }
