"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"630\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">BELONGING PLAN</text>\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"680\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">- Moai: ___, ___, ___, ___</text>\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"715\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">- Weekly meeting: ___</text>\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"745\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">- Faith/civic: ___, Elder: ___</text>\n                    <rect x=\"80\" y=\"780\" width=\"940\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"830\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">ENVIRONMENT + CALENDAR</text>\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"880\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">- Kitchen/bedroom/workspace change: ___</text>\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"915\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">- 3-pot garden by ___</text>\n                    <text x=\"160\" y=\"945\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">- Day 30/60/90 review dates: ___</text>\n                    <rect x=\"200\" y=\"980\" width=\"700\" height=\"40\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                    <text x=\"550\" y=\"1010\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"20\">Your contract with the next 30 years</text>\n                </svg>",
      "caption": "One page. Tape it where you'll see it daily."
