     "explanation": "If you can only install **one** habit, install the **moai**. A weekly 2-hour walk-and-snack with 4-5 committed friends simultaneously delivers **Move Naturally** (the walk), **Right Tribe** (the people), **Belong** (the ritual), and **Downshift** (the disconnect from screens and stress). The Framingham data shows your friends shape your obesity risk, smoking habits, drinking patterns, and happiness levels. Buettner has stated repeatedly that **if Americans did only this**, the longevity gap with Blue Zones would shrink dramatically. Everything else compounds on top of the social foundation.",
